  <!-- EN: Lesser Mana Potion -->
  <Joe_LesserManaPotion.label>蓝药水(小)</Joe_LesserManaPotion.label>
  <!-- EN: Ancient tribesfolk concocted an elixir that replenishes a modest amount of mana and significantly amplifies the arcane load dispersal for those who imbibe it. However, there is a slight risk that individuals may fall under its addictive spell.\n(Medieval Medicines Medieval Overhaul Edition) -->
  <Joe_LesserManaPotion.description>一种古老部落酿制的法力药水，能恢复服用者少量的精神力，增加心灵熵消散率。然而，可能会导致服用者陷入成瘾，存在轻微的风险。</Joe_LesserManaPotion.description>
